## Command

```shell
biome lint file.js
```

## `biome.json`

```json
{
  "javascript": { "experimentalEmbeddedSnippetsEnabled": true },
  "linter": {
    "rules": {
      "recommended": false,
      "suspicious": {
        "noIrregularWhitespace": "error"
      }
    }
  }
}
```

## `file.js`

```js
const Button = styled.button`
  &:hover {
    padding:　10px;
  }
  &::before {
    content: "　";
  }
`;

```

